    with tabs[0]: _portfolio_evolution_what_changed(sim)
    with tabs[1]: _portfolio_evolution_time_machine(sim)
    with tabs[2]: _portfolio_evolution_drift(sim)
    with tabs[3]: _portfolio_evolution_pnl(sim)
